Axiom add_SNo_minus_Le2b : forall x y z , SNo x -> SNo y -> SNo z -> z + y <= x -> z <= x + - y.
Axiom add_SNo_Lt_subprop2 : forall x y z w u v , SNo x -> SNo y -> SNo z -> SNo w -> SNo u -> SNo v -> x + u < z + v -> y + v < w + u -> x + y < z + w.
