Axiom prime_factorization_ex_uniq : forall n , nat_p n -> 0 :e n -> exists k :e omega , exists f : set -> set , nonincrfinseq prime_nat k f /\ Pi_SNo f k = n /\ forall k' :e omega , forall f' : set -> set , nonincrfinseq prime_nat k' f' -> Pi_SNo f' k' = n -> k' = k /\ forall i :e k , f' i = f i.
End PrimeFactorization.
