Section form27.
Axiom sup_le_inf_of_forall_Le : forall A B , A c= R -> B c= R -> nonempty A -> nonempty B -> (forall x :e A , forall y :e B , x <= y) -> has_lub A /\ has_glb B /\ sup A <= inf B.
