Section form31.
Axiom abs_R_closed : forall x :e R , abs_SNo x :e R.
Axiom abs_R_Le_iff : forall x y :e R , abs_SNo x <= y <-> (- y <= x /\ x <= y).
Axiom R_minus_add_distr : forall a b :e R , - (a + b) = (- a) + (- b).
Axiom abs_R_triangle : forall x y :e R , abs_SNo (x + y) <= abs_SNo x + abs_SNo y.
