Axiom Rn_matrix_entry_R_closed : forall n :e omega , forall m :e omega , forall A :e LXY (Rn n) (Rn_add n) (Rn_zero n) (Rn_neg n) (Rn_smul n) (Rn m) (Rn_add m) (Rn_zero m) (Rn_neg m) (Rn_smul m) , forall i :e m , forall j :e n , Rn_matrix_entry n m A i j :e R.
