Axiom Rn_matrix_entries_sqr_sum_R_closed : forall n :e omega , forall m :e omega , forall A :e LXY (Rn n) (Rn_add n) (Rn_zero n) (Rn_neg n) (Rn_smul n) (Rn m) (Rn_add m) (Rn_zero m) (Rn_neg m) (Rn_smul m) , Rn_matrix_entries_sqr_sum n m A :e R.
