Axiom exists_linear_of_matrix_Rn : forall n :e omega , forall m :e omega , forall M :e matrix_space_Rn m n , exists A :e LXY (Rn n) (Rn_add n) (Rn_zero n) (Rn_neg n) (Rn_smul n) (Rn m) (Rn_add m) (Rn_zero m) (Rn_neg m) (Rn_smul m) , matrix_of_linear_Rn n m A = M.
