Axiom Rn_affine_segment_mem_of_convex : forall n :e omega , forall U , is_convex (Rn n) (Rn_add n) (Rn_zero n) (Rn_neg n) (Rn_smul n) U -> forall x :e U , forall y :e U , forall t :e Icc 0 1 , Rn_add n (Rn_smul n (1 + (- t)) x) (Rn_smul n t y) :e U.
