Section form80.
Axiom darboux_sum_lower_seq_Le_riemann_integral_Icc : forall a b :e R , a <= b -> forall f : set -> set , bounded_fun (Icc a b) f -> forall n :e omega , forall p : set -> set , is_partition_seq_Icc a b n p -> darboux_sum_lower_seq f n p <= riemann_integral_Icc a b f.
