Axiom ms_continuous_on_rect_imp_iterated_integral_yx_in_R : forall a1 b1 a2 b2 :e R , a1 <= b1 -> a2 <= b2 -> forall f : set -> set , ms_continuous_on f (Rn 2) (Rn_dist 2) R dist_R (rect_Icc_R2 a1 b1 a2 b2) -> iterated_integral_yx_Icc a1 b1 a2 b2 f :e R.
