Axiom fubini_Icc_R2 : forall a1 b1 a2 b2 :e R , a1 <= b1 -> a2 <= b2 -> forall f : set -> set , ms_continuous_on f (Rn 2) (Rn_dist 2) R dist_R (rect_Icc_R2 a1 b1 a2 b2) -> iterated_integral_xy_Icc a1 b1 a2 b2 f = iterated_integral_yx_Icc a1 b1 a2 b2 f.
Axiom ms_continuous_on_subq : forall f : set -> set , forall X Y : set , forall dX dY : set -> set -> set , forall K K' : set , K' c= K -> ms_continuous_on f X dX Y dY K -> ms_continuous_on f X dX Y dY K'.
