Axiom god1_group_word_append_in : forall p , forall f : set -> set , forall a i , i :e p -> group_word_append p f a i = f i.
Axiom god1_group_word_append_last : forall p , nat_p p -> forall f : set -> set , forall a , group_word_append p f a p = a.
