Axiom god1_group_word_append_product : forall G , forall mul : set -> set -> set , forall p , forall f : set -> set , forall a , nat_p p -> group_word_product G mul (group_word_append p f a) (ordsucc p) = mul (group_word_product G mul f p) a.
