Axiom god1_group_word_product_in_step : forall G , forall mul : set -> set -> set , forall f : set -> set , forall n , group G mul -> nat_p n -> ((forall i :e n , f i :e G) -> group_word_product G mul f n :e G) -> (forall i :e ordsucc n , f i :e G) -> group_word_product G mul f (ordsucc n) :e G.
