Axiom god1_group_word_represented_mul_word : forall G , forall mul : set -> set -> set , forall B z , forall f : set -> set , forall p , group G mul -> group_word_represented G mul B z -> nat_p p -> (forall i :e p , group_word_letter G mul B (f i)) -> group_word_represented G mul B (mul z (group_word_product G mul f p)).
