Axiom god1_group_word_product_in_subgroup_step : forall G , forall mul : set -> set -> set , forall B H , forall f : set -> set , forall n , subgroup G mul H -> B c= H -> nat_p n -> ((forall i :e n , group_word_letter G mul B (f i)) -> group_word_product G mul f n :e H) -> (forall i :e ordsucc n , group_word_letter G mul B (f i)) -> group_word_product G mul f (ordsucc n) :e H.
