Axiom god1_module_homomorphisms_equal_on_basis : forall K , forall addK mulK : set -> set -> set , forall X , forall addX smulX : set -> set -> set , forall I , forall a : set -> set , forall M , forall addM smulM : set -> set -> set , forall f g : set -> set , module_basis K addK mulK X addX smulX I a -> left_module K addK mulK M addM smulM -> module_homomorphism K addK mulK X addX smulX M addM smulM f -> module_homomorphism K addK mulK X addX smulX M addM smulM g -> (forall i :e I , f (a i) = g (a i)) -> forall x :e X , f x = g x.
