Axiom god1_fraction_nonzero_multiplicative_inverse : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , integral_domain K add mul -> forall x :e fraction_field K add mul , x <> ring_zero (fraction_field K add mul) (fraction_addition K add mul) -> exists y :e fraction_field K add mul , fraction_multiplication K add mul x y = ring_one (fraction_field K add mul) (fraction_multiplication K add mul).
