Axiom god1_fraction_embedding_inverse_candidate_product : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , integral_domain K add mul -> forall b :e K , b <> ring_zero K add -> fraction_multiplication K add mul (fraction_embedding K add mul b) (fraction_class K add mul (ring_one K mul,b)) = ring_one (fraction_field K add mul) (fraction_multiplication K add mul).
Axiom god1_fraction_embedding_inverse_formula : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , integral_domain K add mul -> forall b :e K , b <> ring_zero K add -> ring_inverse (fraction_field K add mul) (fraction_addition K add mul) (fraction_multiplication K add mul) (fraction_embedding K add mul b) = fraction_class K add mul (ring_one K mul,b).
Axiom god1_fraction_class_quotient_representation : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , integral_domain K add mul -> forall p :e fraction_pairs K add , fraction_class K add mul p = fraction_multiplication K add mul (fraction_embedding K add mul (p 0)) (ring_inverse (fraction_field K add mul) (fraction_addition K add mul) (fraction_multiplication K add mul) (fraction_embedding K add mul (p 1))).
