Axiom god1_eigenvalues_are_characteristic_roots : forall K , forall addK mulK : set -> set -> set , forall E , forall addE smul : set -> set -> set , forall n :e omega , forall a : set -> set , forall u : set -> set , forall lambda :e K , field K addK mulK -> module_basis K addK mulK E addE smul n a -> module_endomorphism K addK mulK E addE smul u -> (endomorphism_eigenvalue K addK mulK E addE smul u lambda <-> polynomial_zero K addK mulK K addK mulK 1 (endomorphism_characteristic_polynomial K addK mulK E addE smul n a u) (fun i => lambda)).
