Axiom god1_characteristic_permutation_factor_in : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , forall n :e omega , forall A :e square_matrix_ring K n , forall sigma :e permutation_group n , forall j :e n , field K add mul -> god1_characteristic_permutation_factor K add mul n A sigma j :e multivariate_polynomial_ring K add 1.
