Axiom god1_characteristic_permutation_product_degree : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , forall n :e omega , forall A :e square_matrix_ring K n , forall sigma :e permutation_group n , field K add mul -> (forall j :e n , god1_characteristic_permutation_factor K add mul n A sigma j <> (fun exponent :e omega :^: 1 => ring_zero K add)) -> polynomial_total_degree K add 1 (god1_characteristic_permutation_product K add mul n A sigma) = finite_cardinality {j :e n|sigma j = j}.
Axiom god1_natural_difference_one_two_successor : forall n :e omega , 2 :e ordsucc n -> natural_difference n 1 = ordsucc (natural_difference n 2).
