Axiom god1_identity_characteristic_permutation_product_top_coefficients : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , forall n :e omega , forall A :e square_matrix_ring K n , field K add mul -> 0 :e n -> god1_characteristic_permutation_product K add mul n A (permutation_identity n) (fun i :e 1 => n) = cofactor_sign_scalar K add mul n /\ god1_characteristic_permutation_product K add mul n A (permutation_identity n) (fun i :e 1 => natural_difference n 1) = mul (cofactor_sign_scalar K add mul (natural_difference n 1)) (matrix_trace K add n A).
