Axiom god1_matrix_characteristic_polynomial_permutation_expansion : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , forall n :e omega , commutative_ring K add mul -> forall A :e square_matrix_ring K n , matrix_characteristic_polynomial K add mul n A = module_finitely_supported_sum (multivariate_polynomial_ring K add 1) (polynomial_addition K add 1) (permutation_group n) (fun sigma => polynomial_multiplication K add mul 1 (signature_scalar (multivariate_polynomial_ring K add 1) (polynomial_addition K add 1) (polynomial_multiplication K add mul 1) n sigma) (god1_characteristic_permutation_product K add mul n A sigma)).
Axiom god1_signature_scalar_in : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , ring K add mul -> forall n sigma , signature_scalar K add mul n sigma :e K.
