Axiom god1_characteristic_polynomial_coefficient_from_identity_permutation : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , forall n :e omega , forall A :e square_matrix_ring K n , forall exponent :e omega :^: 1 , field K add mul -> (forall sigma :e permutation_group n , sigma <> permutation_identity n -> god1_characteristic_permutation_product K add mul n A sigma exponent = ring_zero K add) -> matrix_characteristic_polynomial K add mul n A exponent = god1_characteristic_permutation_product K add mul n A (permutation_identity n) exponent.
Axiom god1_characteristic_polynomial_leading_trace_and_constant_terms : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , forall n :e omega , forall A :e square_matrix_ring K n , field K add mul -> 0 :e n -> let p := matrix_characteristic_polynomial K add mul n A in p (fun i :e 1 => n) = cofactor_sign_scalar K add mul n /\ p (fun i :e 1 => natural_difference n 1) = mul (cofactor_sign_scalar K add mul (natural_difference n 1)) (matrix_trace K add n A) /\ p (fun i :e 1 => 0) = matrix_determinant K add mul n A.
Axiom god1_cofactor_sign_scalar_nonzero : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , integral_domain K add mul -> forall k , cofactor_sign_scalar K add mul k <> ring_zero K add.
