Axiom god1_positive_exponent_nonzero_coefficient_gives_positive_degree : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , forall f :e multivariate_polynomial_ring K add 1 , forall exponent :e omega :^: 1 , ring K add mul -> f exponent <> ring_zero K add -> 0 :e exponent_total_degree 1 (fun i => exponent i) -> polynomial_total_degree K add 1 f :e omega /\ 0 :e polynomial_total_degree K add 1 f.
