Axiom god1_endomorphism_power_kernel_is_submodule : forall K , forall addK mulK : set -> set -> set , forall E , forall addE smul : set -> set -> set , forall u : set -> set , forall r :e omega , module_endomorphism K addK mulK E addE smul u -> submodule K addK mulK E addE smul (endomorphism_power_kernel K addK mulK E addE smul u r).
