Axiom god1_endomorphism_power_kernel_successor_complement : forall K , forall addK mulK : set -> set -> set , forall E , forall addE smul : set -> set -> set , forall u : set -> set , forall i :e omega , field K addK mulK -> 0 :e i -> finite_dimensional_vector_space K addK mulK E addE smul -> module_endomorphism K addK mulK E addE smul u -> exists F , vector_subspace K addK mulK E addE smul F /\ direct_sum_decomposition K addK mulK (endomorphism_power_kernel K addK mulK E addE smul u i) addE smul 2 (fun k => if k = 0 then endomorphism_power_kernel K addK mulK E addE smul u (Union i) else F).
