Axiom god1_binary_direct_sum_is_complementary : forall K , forall addK mulK : set -> set -> set , forall L , forall addL smul : set -> set -> set , forall M N , direct_sum_decomposition K addK mulK L addL smul 2 (fun i => if i = 0 then M else N) -> complementary_submodule K addK mulK L addL smul M N.
Axiom god1_dependent_sigma_swap_bijection : forall I J , forall P Q : set -> set , (forall i j , (i :e I /\ j :e P i <-> j :e J /\ i :e Q j)) -> bij (Sigma_ j :e J , Q j) (Sigma_ i :e I , P i) (fun z => (z 1,z 0)).
Axiom god1_natural_difference_successor_involution : forall n :e omega , forall k :e ordsucc n , natural_difference (ordsucc n) (natural_difference n k) = ordsucc k.
Axiom god1_natural_sum_positive_tail_predecessor : forall p k :e omega , 0 :e k -> 0 :e add_nat p k /\ Union (add_nat p k) = add_nat p (Union k).
