Axiom god1_natural_block_position_decomposition : forall r :e omega , forall sizes : set -> set , (forall k :e r , sizes k :e omega) -> forall t :e natural_indexed_sum r sizes , exists k :e r , exists i :e sizes k , t = add_nat (natural_indexed_sum k sizes) i.
Axiom god1_jordan_canonical_matrix_is_upper_triangular : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , forall n :e omega , forall A , jordan_canonical_matrix K add mul n A -> upper_triangular_matrix K add n A.
Axiom god1_empty_jordan_block_data : forall K , forall add mul : set -> set -> set , forall A , exists r :e omega , exists sizes :e omega :^: r , exists lambda :e K :^: r , (forall k :e r , 0 :e sizes k) /\ ring_finite_sum omega add_SNo r (fun k => sizes k) = 0 /\ forall k l :e r , forall i :e sizes k , forall j :e sizes l , matrix_entry A (natural_prefix_sum r (fun h => sizes h) k + i) (natural_prefix_sum r (fun h => sizes h) l + j) = if k = l then if i = j then lambda k else if j = ordsucc i then ring_one K mul else ring_zero K add else ring_zero K add.
